OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fpredominantly cloudy this evening with
OL,7,Fa few brighter breaks possible. Any
OL,8,Fbrightness will soon be replaced by
OL,9,Fthicker cloud and outbreaks of rain,
OL,10,Fsome of which may be heavy. Turning
OL,11,Fdrier in the north towards dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FCloudy start, with outbreaks
OL,14,Fof rain sinking south across Wales.
OL,15,FTurning drier and brighter by mid-
OL,16,Fmorning with sunny spells and showers,
OL,17,Fmostly in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
